   {
    "vid": "emma_larsen",
    "tag": "B-first-meeting",
    "turns": 9,
    "naturalEnd": true,
    "forcedClose": false,
    "transcript": [
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"We're down to 2 liters of clean water.\" I can't carry enough alone. First light, the creek, you and me?"
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"What do you think?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Everyone's got a take. Mine's just the one I can live with.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"How can I help?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"I checked the cistern three times hoping I misread it. 2 liters.\" The creek's a twenty-minute walk — with two of us it's one trip, not three."
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"What’s going on out there?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Everyone's choosing sides and pretending they aren't. I hate it.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"About that favor — we never finished.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"About what's been happening — we never finished.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"I stay out of it. Mostly. It's getting harder.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"About that favor — we never finished.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"About what's been happening — we never finished.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Someone has to say the thing nobody's saying. Probably won't be me.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"About that favor — we never finished.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"I could talk all day, but — go on. We'll talk more.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"About what's been happening — we never finished.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"I talk to both sides. It hasn't exploded yet.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Take care of yourself. I mean that.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
     }
